node_modules/
# package-lock.json IS committed on purpose: it pins the Remotion versions the render was verified
# against, and the remote finishing workflow needs it for `npm ci` and for its cache key.
# staged render inputs, and any test output
__clip-*
__audio-*
*.mp4
# ...except the fixture check.mjs renders against. It is committed on purpose so a fresh clone can run
# check.mjs stage 2 (ffprobe) without regenerating it first.
!public/selftest-input.mp4
log*.txt
